Generated code
==============

Files generated by tools from third-party schemas, rather than written by
hand, were already in the repository when this file was introduced:

  packages/nebula/imports/
    Kubernetes custom resource definitions imported with cdk8s import.
  pulumi/sdks/ and pulumi/packages/nebula/src/crossplane-crds/
    Pulumi SDK and custom resource packages generated by
    pulumi-language-nodejs and crd2pulumi, with their helper scripts.

Most of these files state in their first lines that they were generated.
The schemas they were generated from remain under the licenses of their
upstream projects. Generated code of this kind that is added later is
listed under Entries.
